      "tool": "sme_ai_use_policy_drafter_decision",
      "prompt": "Create a pragmatic owner decision plan for allowed and prohibited uses, data handling, human review duties, tool approval, and training. Include the recommended decision, rejected alternatives, first 72-hour actions, owners, metrics, and review triggers. Keep advice bounded by the provided facts and mark anything that needs finance, legal, safety, or compliance review. Return JSON only.",
